### Phase 3: Compilation, Execution & Verification

#### 11. Compile Java program

```bash
rm -rf build
mkdir build
javac -cp "$(hadoop classpath)" -d build src/LoginDuration.java

```

#### 12. Verify compiled classes

```bash
find build -type f

```

#### 13. Create JAR file

```bash
jar -cvf LoginDuration.jar -C build .

```

#### 14. Remove previous output directories

```bash
hdfs dfs -rm -r -f /user/$USER/login_project/output1
hdfs dfs -rm -r -f /user/$USER/login_project/output2

```

#### 15. Execute both MapReduce jobs

```bash
hadoop jar LoginDuration.jar LoginDuration \
/user/$USER/login_project/input \
/user/$USER/login_project/output1 \
/user/$USER/login_project/output2

```

#### 16. Display individual user durations

```bash
hdfs dfs -cat /user/$USER/login_project/output1/part-r-00000

```

#### 17. Display maximum login duration

```bash
hdfs dfs -cat /user/$USER/login_project/output2/part-r-00000

```

#### 18. Verify output directories

```bash
hdfs dfs -ls /user/$USER/login_project/output1
hdfs dfs -ls /user/$USER/login_project/output2

```

#### 19. Stop Hadoop services after completion

```bash
stop-yarn.sh
stop-dfs.sh

```
